{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/934687-which-weapon-s-load-out-would-you-take-for-a-battle-at-helm-s-deep-or-minas-tirith","id":934687,"title":"Which weapon's load out would you take for a battle at Helm's Deep or Minas tirith..","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-20T13:35:51-07:00","id":934687,"title":"Which weapon's load out would you take for a battle at Helm's Deep or Minas tirith..","content":"On a # of my other sites i hit, i have asked this strange hypothetical situation.<br /> <br /> Lets say you and some earth weaponry some how got teleported into Middle Earth during the time frame of the lord of the Rings Two Towers/Return of the king. BUT once that battle you stayed at was over, you came back.<br /> <br /> Which battle would you stick around at?<br /> Which of the following 'weapon loadouts' would you go with?<br /> <br /> Loadout 1 is:<br /> 2 .50 caliber machine guns, triopds, and 3 boxes of 250 rounds for each gun.<br /> 4 M4 machine guns with 5 magazines of 30 rounds and<br /> 4 Law rockets.<br /> <br /> Load out 2 is:<br /> 4 SAWs with 3 boxes of 150 rounds each<br /> 6 M16 machine guns with 4 clips of 30 rounds each and<br /> 2 boxes of 25 grenades<br /> <br /> Load out 3 is:<br /> 3. 6 30.06 rifles with 100 shells each. 10 RPGs with 10 shells each and 10 claymores.<br /> <br /> Load out 4 is:<br /> 4. 2 Barret50s with 200 rounds each. 12 40mm grenade launchers with 12 shells each, and 8 claymores.<br /> <br /> Load out 5 is:<br /> 10 Desert eagles, each with 100 rounds, 10 H&amp;K-MP5s each with 120 rounds, 10 H&amp;K PSG-1 sniper rifles each with 100 rounds, 1 box with 50lb of cemtex, 20 detonators and 1 box with 30 bouncing betties.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T09:11:55-07:00","id":935635,"title":"","content":"None of the above.<br /> <br /> Not only am I personally a horrible shot, but with all those folks fighting close quarters, you're about as likely to hit your friendlies as hit your foes.<br /> <br /> I'm taking a good solid axe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T13:17:44-07:00","id":935763,"title":"","content":"Yea, but if you can shoot the enemy 400+ yards OUT, and take out a lot before they get INTO close quarters, the axe is less needed!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T13:33:40-07:00","id":935777,"title":"","content":"How are you going to carry everything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user"