eapons would be nice, but not necessary. Knowing what the enemy\u2019s going to do is a huge (Yuge!) advantage.<br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Helms Deep: Instruct the elves to look for unarmored orcs running with a torch; these will be priority targets.<br /> Gondor: Instruct trebuchets to look for a large structure that doesn\u2019t look like the rest of Mordor\u2019s siege engines. It\u2019s a good bet this will be the battering ram. Once located, make that the priority target. </span><br /> Gondor, however, is working under a much tighter time crunch. The battering ram takes its sweet time getting to the gate, but my more serious cousins were quick to take out the trebuchets with their felbeasts. </span></div> </div> </div> </div>Better yet for Minas tirith, Don't do how that suck head did, and under defend that river town like they did, letting it get TAKEN by the orks.. Then once it DID get taken, don't go commanding your horses to charge back in to re-take it knowing they will get mowed down by arrow fire..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T18:16:59-07:00","id":946600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>garhkal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/934687-which-weapon-s-load-out-would-you-take-for-a-battle-at-helm-s-deep-or-minas-tirith?p=946464#post946464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Better yet for Minas tirith, Don't do how that suck head did, and under defend that river town like they did, letting it get TAKEN by the orks.. Then once it DID get taken, don't go commanding your horses to charge back in to re-take it knowing they will get mowed down by arrow fire..</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">Yeah, Walter Bishop did not have a gift for strategy.<br /> Since Regent Walter seemed to be the weakest point in Minas Tirith's defense (Gandalf tried!), how do you think it would pan out if Walter was assassinated and Faramir took proper control? I think Gondor's biggest weakness in that battle was lack of competent leadership.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T01:10:59-07:00","id":946806,"title":"","content":"Honestly, i feel if he had been taken out 2-3 weeks BEFORE things got that bad, and Boromir was in charge, it might have ended up a lot differently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"th